menu "C++ Support"

config CPP_SUPPORT
    bool "Enable C++ Support"
    default y
    help
      Enable this option to add support for C++ in the project.
      This includes necessary configurations and settings to compile and link C++ code.

config CPP_EXCEPTIONS
    bool "Enable C++ Exceptions"
    depends on CPLUSPLUS_SUPPORT
    default n
    help
      Enable this option to support C++ exception handling.
      Note that enabling exceptions may increase code size and impact performance.

config CPP_RTTI
    bool "Enable C++ RTTI (Run-Time Type Information)"
    depends on CPLUSPLUS_SUPPORT
    default n
    help
      Enable this option to support Run-Time Type Information in C++.
      RTTI allows the use of dynamic_cast and typeid operators.

endmenu
